+/* CPU-feature MASK (default ON): the qemu64 guest reports no BMI2, so the
+ * boot decompressor runs the `_default` (non-BMI2) clones of every
+ * HUF/ZSTD hot loop.  A host with BMI2 would silently exercise the `_bmi2`
